                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Animal Lover is an urban fantasy visual novel about helping a set of men break a curse that affects all of them. The gameplay mechanics are standard choices in visual novels. The main selling point is the characters. I think they're all well written and distinct from one another. It is a little weird that a visual novel has a canon route but I also agree with it so I'll let it slide. If I had to offer a criticism there are some characters that are implied to exist but don't have any presence in the story. For example, the main character has parents but we only hear from one.\n\nIn short, a good visual novel with good characters.",
